  "_doc": "Light Minute (space), 'vast and calm': E dorian at 56.25 BPM (a beat is 32 frames, a 16th exactly 8 frames at 30 fps). No piano: open pads in a long hall over a held drone of fifths (E and B), with slow gliding open fifths as the only melody. Labels are telemetry pings, never glass bells (they are Lumevina's). Nothing booms in a vacuum: every effect is tonal (pings, glides, swells), never an impact. Signature: pings E5, B5, F#6, 6 frames apart (root, fifth and ninth with no third: a question opening). It plays on the title ring (signature) and at the end of every counter. The voice stays dry and close; the music ducks 10 dB under it.",
